{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1417,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad1d8ae9029ed3a92439c4bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您让我心中找到了光辉。\n那时的相遇现在依然\n是我所骄傲的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47b3e9ffc3e465ae03df66e0d659709441be56bd149aff02984362d098f3b061",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:667b051a73eef213476944e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感受到了学园的历史…\n身体紧张起来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b4970b7c9a8c669c5880e20e5c7317193499cddac45ff52a664e65643cfd5fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcc8ab2867ae67e6426877ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚步很轻盈…\n好像能跳出最好的舞蹈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0def963800fa2a958e44a50ddbea9ff035d0143faebf44ff85f28f395548be7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acdfd38cf6a39e3740a339a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个胸针给予了我勇气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "338d7d83f2c4935e6d14aab962913593f79a97ba417e0dd30b2e91f2067070d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f960a1c432c80ac56393ac68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发的时候\n要衣冠整齐，挺直腰板。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0a316f2228f07a99cf3392b63f90800043fcf094a3e76b053ff6f11c2351c23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c698d768c1948afb5d5762e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "梦中的服装…华丽的光辉，\n让人看得出神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4edfe3a671fc6a160022e5308c8dbb42bb023ee848ce2aea5ec8d46a04e7334a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8b0d57d88527c5e751006e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黑白形成的对比。\n使光辉，更加突出…",
      "source_fingerprint": "70b97306c43b53d72079229aa091ae8eb6a01a4ebd5061f73dd02e2ceee81e24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cd4abed51890495abfbcf02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以的话，\r\n愿意一起跳支舞吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1621a15ed17b38b2ee2ba668be05d1344c71400898c8065e2f300a88c92b09e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91372e92a0ec6a24b5a786f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉身心都振奋了起来，\r\n看来裤装的打扮也不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb304ce380633db24078044f25d575ad2d33a5c58d105355ce91a7ed51630d53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55c53be08523d54d1bb6c7a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，真漂亮呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3e9c285c27563027e9fd5dcca1d3139b1f6b2ec940530b09cbf32daeda3f39b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c59bf67937291c988166ddf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是这身衣服的话，好像能更加闪耀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a28286b1d192fa310252b84bcc9482dc234a44f94c20181319e8e610fece268",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9744f162e2388682c8336bc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我换好衣服了，\n是要去哪里吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2b3b03c1715033e90893d99312d3edd0fac8d08b9b4347c7a78c57922e3c85b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b30f33265d8d14c464bc96f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是平淡无奇的日子，\n也一起好好度过吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d12c84b5c295f2539dc694da2d5db395074867353bb7d4f974faf52d22732433",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13ae33806b2eb71c25516641",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感受到了学园的历史…\n身体紧张起来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b4970b7c9a8c669c5880e20e5c7317193499cddac45ff52a664e65643cfd5fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "71004"
      ]
