      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ca0b63601be12301cec3b1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，真漂亮呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3e9c285c27563027e9fd5dcca1d3139b1f6b2ec940530b09cbf32daeda3f39b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b2aa98c98c894de40dc56d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是这身衣服的话，好像能更加闪耀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a28286b1d192fa310252b84bcc9482dc234a44f94c20181319e8e610fece268",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d712c405cb3f4b78771e8360",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83a97b817e3627abcd1a9a0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的觉悟光辉，\n来见识一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c34f0db4e4e1d9db82af8f4063d8061d138d8aba9a83159daf10bd01b78f6a09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4efe6ee1fcb185e4e30d2f3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "此时、此刻。\n感谢幸运让我和您这样的强敌相遇。\n来吧……再一战，决胜负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2c466884c3f27f4aaf16d7fdcb53c16f1f49bbf6eddde39368424be7a082ecd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:244b7ac120d384d6601b8acd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好。在早餐菜单上\n的红茶滴上蜂蜜…是\n愉快的一天的开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a9606d29b70362b31009f937c2f60384377e72b027646fc760d785ec5932507",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbf3eb58e01a8ff2bf92a3ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啦，看起来还有点困\n的样子。如果需要的话…\n我弄点提神的香薰吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "969bcf66b83380463338688383abc0508a2133578f9ebc9e654141635643aeb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8925ed7b404ff332e727bb06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午休时，和保健室的老师一起\n喝茶了。因为经常去…所以要在\n平时也表达感谢之情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8137994afce1c569c06d9d3a8a37061c933eed2b2fea43033d7de5b09a07adcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3df1a736767995743704d781",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和朋友聚在一起，吃着\n热气腾腾的料理…中午的自主餐厅，\n无论去多少次都让人心动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8e1f99154b68e92078ed49931178cc6db2f13fe83db779fb9ba04a48fb57b96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77a2be64eafd75701826ed5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，不能这样…呣！\n…怎么样？溪流同学亲自传授的\n防止熬夜的对策。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cbe149ef2bcf5f413833995e6e4c0bbf53c9ac398e964c5e2780a14f0aa2f8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac5ddcd08ea324d3fbc746c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这么安静的夜晚，真想去散步啊。\n没有太阳的话，好像可以稍微\n伸展翅膀…一起去怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7777863633c1b5e085e87e080f309d20260cdc94d3012e52785492b03e45374",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f594edd90024268eba9b560",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新生们的侧脸，\n每一个都闪耀着以梦想为目标的光芒。\n…呵呵。不知不觉，眼睛就眯起来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b7ef59ce2689dde07b9f380e2252ab4f47c66db2afe461ad4435030efa753e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea8db327fcb2ef2914521107",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才，遇到了抱着\n向日葵花束的善信…\n那个笑容，和向日葵很像♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "beb38d478f974ed861317b35514b5a559d0efde1e322ef54a14e7c981fb1096c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42961ba41ccfb55fe7e4ac3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得，熬夜是不行的\n…但不知不觉就想把\n责任推些给季节更迭。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86964b3002556fc4c9fbc1d60447879a6eecfca40739bd72dd8ca785d4b042c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7f035f4416b9d56469eae8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上的浓汤，让我想起了\n奶奶亲手做的味道。在寒冷的\n日子里…喝点温暖的汤…",
      "source_fingerprint": "1533a9b102dc465814ddbf6c2553c2fdb854b179013c63a070111c33741d23ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ad733e1a7d0e578ba391be7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安。\r\n今天也能够一如既往地持续奔跑，\r\n让我深感喜悦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d6c8c4e37f3e414bde94c365a0496087a9c5be437bf98a5725660f91d2e9d76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13eb5c1892dfc45d9b729a11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宅邸里的按摩师告诉了我\r\n提神的穴道。要不要试试看，\r\n让我替你按个一下呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b01c379cc755b65963d37ce6efde087d863c70ff72fe5dc49047e326c96a2525",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:691dd13857199cf6e5ecea1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我偶尔会买金平糖当零食。\r\n它澄澈通透的外观，以及在嘴里\r\n缥缈地消失的口感让我相当喜欢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8325be4073148405cb0e132cff15cbfca1aa9de167452b1e09a2d69a3c0b3ba9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92e815ba9cce87ea94be3269",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在即使身在拥挤的咖啡厅里，\r\n我也能够顺利穿越人潮了。\r\n似乎是因为舞蹈的经验起了帮助♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "46f00788d719066083d9fdf0ab474b13f13ae5ce2c58705a6cc4e1f6c0804482",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3427d5e3e29834ebeb6b0f3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回到宿舍并进入梦乡后，\r\n今天就结束了……\r\n一想到这里，就会舍不得回去呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f336002aedb5fd7055f6f9258825338c3c1bb8c33ad6c217da2a6b5605de9330",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50d952ca97042961b6e49a05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被星星和路灯照亮的街道，\r\n与舞厅有几分相似……\r\n置身其中偶尔会想跳起舞来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e68858a1f48ebe1b37fbcad65da8da65727c895c1abea15b92bf6421d46450db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3faa05728db0c5885bacf51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个时节的樱花随风飞舞，\r\n看起来像在跳华尔兹……\r\n让人不知不觉就看入迷了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b48b03e3775282dda06b3ce9aebc936afcb594b31099254063ef3c9a9076a3c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c4d96e5ac00e140897241c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然不能过于勉强自己……但我想\r\n玩沙滩排球、打西瓜，和大家一起\r\n做些富有夏日气息的活动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3a6dad31aac2679ea8095b1ce212d7a05257efa4259096750f73d94b00148fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c760378e1b4f599909a6c8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天的佳肴……让我跃跃欲试呢。\r\n品尝运用当季食材做成的药膳料理，\r\n让我们一起好好进行食补养生吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9224258137763d4ac5e070dfd8f25c18b0869940b4e45efcac500796d691d9b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:752a5782f1e2e5879e97bf17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「想触碰」和「不触碰让它\r\n自己融化」……每当看见雪时，\r\n就会产生这种二律背反似的心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a95877b7170f50c25f77942410316deca17f829e0ea8d6f447a96fd43d3fc62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa3bf4c374f4b17d3cbab751",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ce55f0b6dec3979e6fda052",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1523096e3b1e072f7ac9b74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前几天，发现了姐姐小时候的\n照片。小小的年纪就已凛然美丽…\n看起来很耀眼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bff2fab42d67e3d6dc99697ec5b310c733b7337180ce0d863ae89a2b855fc2fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f100b9324599b96c4921679",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你知道吗，通过玉藻的砍价技术…\n可以窥见其中的义理人情。\n就好像在看单口相声一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e182b980ad3ce9c961ec33cefdde4a20afb77c60056ec724ce78068d0bfc438",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e98b2efcdff9fa5e271eefb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "玻璃破碎的声音…为什么\n那么独特呢。那尖锐的声音…\n总觉得不习惯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d050689b5dbc54d105de1d9f167f25e7a1e74969cbc0cd1b85a6e67cbbd78da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59d86547bc4b60eb1012e11c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太阳神刚才传来一个好消息…\n『新的奶茶店开张Vay★』。呵呵，\n绕远路还是有惊喜的呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "224f9e77faf3b71d188bde933dde26f3b3797eae430a5ffb97199081ebd6683c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a07f64af732a7e7ab3b4aef7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实，我在犹豫送什么礼物\n给目白家的主治医师…果然还是\n送工作用具…针，怎么样呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ca906a68f16e6f14be9c57f9eea52b6555c0f99dd40e0ad5540ed6e6f38ef82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b60dc0cc7199625012f0e323",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肚脐露出来的衣服很新鲜呢。\n华丽的服装，激烈的舞蹈…\n呵呵，连心脏都跳跃起来了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "012ae6cdfe23009d3fd5dffbdc1ba3c15183c3dba3ec9883be9ba1f91144df6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1082c058efd8f658f9e2b71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在病房梦见的那件衣服，\n现在…就穿在身上。\n…真想给那天的我看看啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "129f25d87826235b2a35870398cde7aabc2ee64516a6e7f62257e1f91bb499be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9012ad3a71ed4adb298aad96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胸前的胸针，是父亲送给我\n当作项链的…把手放在上面的话，\n就会很安心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7927c16e872128e1fb47fc7d7b21fb4fbfcb6404f14478dbb99dbe47e9b73f3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26580b0beee5d3795ec700ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外观优雅…对身体的负担也\n计算在内…简直是上乘的决胜服。\n必须用胜利来表示谢意，对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c29559a11e17cb47d3543a4a48a6de0cf3f98b2eb4d32cf97d59a4f5662d90a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:197a505211ae57b1213807e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每天早上摇醒千代王，\n是每天不经意的日常…\n但这对我来说，也是幸福的时光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "acf7e76e30c9a12ff9d35a0428f15d685cfa3e414374546a8f77f06314ff308d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bd187afaca5cf5bdb14280d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小栗帽的吃相总是让人着迷呢，\n多亏了她，我也能吃的更多",
      "source_fingerprint": "849d44dd3203abfc90919ddc929561af20750baa08dce2f737fae4370082aa8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ed024277c7e2206e1862dee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上的茶会是和速子一起喝的，\n红茶闪闪发光的…呵呵，\n真是让人吃惊的体验♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "de7a6d8197d43ac195bc5b8fbdc110c5f0693375bd47f56030712f29dc2ba85a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbfe49de0597801607fa107d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "八重樱很美呢，我这么说之后…\n呵呵，那两位同学的脸颊\n都染上了樱花色呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fbee0826593b2a5a818b3e9a3485b7cb0750d2d6b5999fc0eaef5f416c8639c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d416ef3412838fb34f0d94b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果可以的话，下个休息日…\n要不要去目白家的避暑地？在那里的\n湖畔边读书，别有一番风味哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a5501753d73a25202f894efdd8d005a2c44170bf65a740f79f8be6182f70344",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cacad2d9c4e5a44964e5501",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "红叶的季节虽短，\n但那一瞬却如燃烧般讴歌。…\n令人神魂颠倒，真美丽啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "adbca3d1a399d3cf8f2c0c781ce0bb77db89572004a447f64a6974390a870994",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37a7774cd246fdc06fd340d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵。每当冬天来临，我就会\n想起来。被劝着穿上厚厚的衣服\n…然后我就被称为目白雪人♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "19a493a72765631430e99ffe6e9196ae2a3ab1c51dbec595a90a86acc67beacc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77d3b3f3cc53537b73611518",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "千代王的舞蹈\r\n就如同她本人一样热情\r\n又率直……非常耀眼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a849f47d19d3df71f52578ac043e3d6730b3e3aa498687bfb2b94b849e2a002b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e688983cd2554b3806b764d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐对竞赛所怀抱的情感既深邃，\r\n又纯粹，并且崇高……就像在面对\r\n唯一的伴侣一般。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a280c2b245baaece5592f0c4d33391e5748eb48c7dbe0ec32ae8da640369d988",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f95095dec50ca840c196ace",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "彼此竞争、相互砥砺……\r\n麦昆和帝王的关系\r\n真的非常美好呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3be0779982b3885467d7c6222d65ac9aefbc8769e7126b29e40df66d474c42e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41968361949b95736dc05c6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与其隐藏想法却换来后悔，\r\n我希望不论结果如何，\r\n都能毫不掩饰地传达出去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f50bd916ae5b67f9c525bca58fe8c82566761b03a5b7e4e45829157898fc9808",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:170d8b164722c1320dde0716",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "丸姐的舞蹈技巧好像是在\r\n舞厅？培养出来的样子呢。\r\n下次我也去看看好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9870a50c2fba9f34257345f75a49a05151e67ab7ccc1f5d6b92b1f1920ed2de0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f734add1f8881fddd5f136ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我偶尔睡过头时，\r\n会有很可爱的闹钟喊着\r\n「千代千代～快起床～」来叫醒我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "876a896ce4e8ea70f357fbe52647426d6de2ee62224171a3f6a717b8c9f2f4b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af391e48ecebb3c15a91b0a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在下午不仅会留心要多活动，\r\n午餐也会选择对胃部负担较少，\r\n并能有效帮助强健体魄的食物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78f0e9266064eaea5ad240fe5190c685b77faa158b55619bfa903ac0c71d831c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cce82d26f15e7a23299ad98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我最近经常做\r\n练习舞蹈的梦，这算是\r\n一种脑中模拟训练吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "60c98e26a308127a0061854e356b4132758b8a7106b51cb6abba87c8518bf006",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce5ddcbcee035404b99476b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若餐桌上端出了\r\n以春告鱼作为食材的料理，\r\n就会让人觉得春天造访了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ddf3d361d5e420bc826bba9c2252cbf5314f238c7837bb6e6f65143fc0d71b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bdebf53b94d09d27bd8160c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利俱乐部的盆舞大赛上……\r\n最令人印象深刻的莫过于从头\r\n到尾都很有活力的千代王吧？呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "72d63f9e3da3f2a12bc416dd7bda356ca49af078584eba1352a57f2254149625",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8533dca852c665380974ba72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被整片枫叶包围，在画布上\r\n尽情挥洒的姐姐──光是这副景象\r\n就堪称是艺术品……",
      "source_fingerprint": "11814d40f4e076e66e9ebd4ff7ff48b6fce3e9ef7e77af009a5485d50d856b52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17baea2b3ebc91e27181b3ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在滑冰场发抖的八重\r\n实在太过可爱……甚至让我\r\n不禁想保护起她了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b5bdca68fc0f19cca2c6f3d68b5cbf02bfbe89ce48c80d7ca4a8e8489b7ae4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59edcc7b9973903264152057",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这身衣服后，\r\n便被大家称为「雪白的你」……\r\n让我有些害羞呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dbae4da13d993580254ccbaceb6cf9b1eb3bde370fd23a7822801ad05b5fa3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c658ef0231d6b5fc147fe5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪与樱花──这身美丽的衣服\r\n是加入了我们彼此的特色后，\r\n制作而成的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48fda5979965df34040c2e4547269bb3ababe5f4c72c000555604a8e99e48267",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f91ae1e23759fae6759918a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然这双脚被称为玻璃，\n但并不是那么容易破碎的。\n这份觉悟，请收下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29b32b24f1669223ed57b3ce4890262a2ea732dc559260bce48a4349535c4206",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc6db99430f70a40109f3fa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起加油吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f30e292881edd41c735771433bdd51933a23886435b9616d6b2f27d4fe1c2e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "920000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
